  "description": "Rate limits for Microsoft.Extensions.AI: an IChatClient middleware that keeps every model call inside a tokens-per-minute, requests-per-minute and concurrency quota per model (reserve an estimate before the call, settle with the real UsageDetails after it), waits in a FIFO queue instead of flooding 429s, and retries 429 / transient failures honouring Retry-After without ever retrying a stream that already produced output. Provider-free. Not affiliated with Microsoft.",
